<title>UK: BoE sets interest rates on index-linked stocks.</title>
<headline>BoE sets interest rates on index-linked stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England on Thursday set the following interest rates on a number of index-linked Treasury stocks --</p>
<p>				    Rate of Interest	  Payment</p>
<p>					  payable		   date</p>
<p>    2.0% I/L stock due 2006	2.21		 July 19, 1997</p>
<p>    2.5% I/L stock due 2016	2.3568	     July 26, 1997</p>
<p>    2.5% I/L stock due 2024	1.9696	     July 17, 1997</p>
<p>    4.125% I/L stock due 2030    2.3495	     July 22, 1997</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
